{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>41歲人夫陳偉霆於11月21日迎來正日生日，並在澳門隆重舉行《Crazy Party瘋狂派對演唱會》與粉絲狂歡 …</p><p></p>\n<p>41歲人夫陳偉霆於11月21日迎來正日生日，並在澳門隆重舉行《Crazy Party瘋狂派對演唱會》與粉絲狂歡。即使去年閃婚超模何穗並升級做爸爸，他的頂流魅力依然無法擋，當晚更連換多套破格戰衣瘋狂騷肌。他在高潮位突然走近台邊做出一個極度大膽舉動，讓全場觀眾陷入失控狀態。</p>\n<h2>陳偉霆澳門開騷換上螢光粉紅戰衣</h2>\n<p>演唱會甫開場便充滿視覺震撼，陳偉霆先以一襲彩虹漸變亮片大露背背帶褲登場，大方展示結實手臂與精壯背肌線條，配合炫目舞台燈光瞬間炒熱氣氛。緊接著他換上一套極具視覺衝擊力螢光粉紅色科幻機甲戰衣驚喜現身，鎧甲胸前設計完全中門大開，將操練多時八塊結實腹肌與深邃人魚線毫無保留呈現眼前。當他帥氣除下未來感頭盔露出俊朗五官時，超強反差魅力令台下尖叫聲震耳欲聾。</p>\n<h2>男神主動走向台邊捉幸運粉絲小手</h2>\n<p>面對全場觀眾不斷高呼「我愛你」狂熱氣氛，陳偉霆直接以超大尺度肢體互動回饋一眾支持者。他一邊展現充滿爆發力灑脫舞步，一邊緩步走向台邊與前排觀眾拉近距離，隨後更親手捉著幸運粉絲雙手共舞。在派對氣氛推向全晚最高峰之際，他竟主動引導粉絲雙手直接摸向自己結實胸肌及腹肌大放寵粉福利，將現場狂熱情緒徹底引爆。</p>\n<h2>迎娶超模何穗誕下愛子無損超強人氣</h2>\n<p>回顧過去一年，這位轉戰內地發展多年並躋身頂流之列巨星經歷了人生重大轉變。去年10月他在毫無預警下投下震撼彈，正式宣布早已與內地超模何穗結婚，兩人更已秘密誕下愛子「小Win」。即使突然公開已婚兼升任人父身分，他依然保持極高人氣，是次澳門演唱會全場門票火速售罄，大批忠實粉絲依然落力入場支持偶像。</p>\n<h2>演唱會派福利片段流出引爆網民洗版</h2>\n<p>這組中門大開曬肌互動片段及高清照片在各大社交平台曝光後，隨即引發大批網民湧入留言區熱烈討論。無數粉絲瘋狂洗版激讚他身形完美，紛紛留言驚呼「太養眼了」以及「根本是腹肌超人」，對其舞台演出給予高度評價。同時亦有不少網民對前排粉絲能夠近距離接觸偶像感到極度羨慕，更有留言搞笑追問「是不是忘記簽保咪協議了」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795490792533270_3551352236b0503e90a073.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"image_太Crazy了震撼美味啊这个伟霆..._0.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795490792533270_3551352236b0503e90a073.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549079695758571_626965816b0503ed5573d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"image_这怎么这么大尺度_这怎么这么大尺..._0.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549079695758571_626965816b0503ed5573d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549079776837797_8716014746b0503ee3ab3f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"image_太Crazy了震撼美味啊这个伟霆..._4.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549079776837797_8716014746b0503ee3ab3f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549080135141026_5355871876b0503f1c6744.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"image_感谢陈伟霆1121给的第一次感谢..._1.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549080135141026_5355871876b0503f1c6744.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549080341712637_11201360736b0503f43c261.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"image_感谢陈伟霆1121给的第一次感谢..._2.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549080341712637_11201360736b0503f43c261.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549080658662103_14015769666b0503f788bc3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"image_感谢陈伟霆1121给的第一次感谢..._8.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549080658662103_14015769666b0503f788bc3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%95%e7%a9%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">何穗</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%bc%94%e5%94%b1%e6%9c%83/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%81%89%e9%9c%86/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳偉霆</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549054\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:24:03.882851+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1253,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:26:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:37:29.934705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T05:17:31.695154+00:00","content_hash":"0825977eb7f3acbbf180c6e130a1f09ca0496d8170ee500e42ebe79d5a21f0df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}